title: "SAFE-NODE: Fail-Safe Real-Time Gas and Fire Safety Network"
abstract: >-
  An ESP32 and FreeRTOS based gas, flame and heat safety network with
  self-diagnostics, watchdog recovery and LoRa reporting, designed so that
  no failure is silent. VConnecTech Engineering Marathon 2026, Team ID M2026-133.
